# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo and on checkout. This silences the
# Windows "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warning and keeps line endings consistent
# across machines and the cloud sessions (overrides per-machine core.autocrlf).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Common binaries — never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
*.zip binary
